### Keep snapshot disposal off the finalizer thread

**Severity:** `medium`

When this safety-net finalizer releases the wrapper's last snapshot lease, the lease callback can synchronously reach the extension-backed snapshot's Dispose() on the CLR finalizer thread. If extension disposal blocks, finalizer processing can stall even though ordinary disposal suppresses finalization. Queue the lease disposal so the finalizer returns without waiting.

```suggestion
        var materializationLease = Interlocked.Exchange(ref _materializationLease, null);
        if (materializationLease is not null)
        {
            ThreadPool.QueueUserWorkItem(
                static state => ((IDisposable)state!).Dispose(),
                materializationLease);
        }
```
